    {
      "id": "3ncSUKZchhlxhgLoChBlK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1606.7940512598548,
      "y": 805.5085683872869,
      "width": 1271.1993408203125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ag",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 204080358,
      "version": 240,
      "versionNonce": 1052197370,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783062408253,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- We can also deploy CDNs closer to user so that they don't have to query across the globe but it will have the same problem or \ngathering analytics as request never hits our primary server.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- We can also deploy CDNs closer to user so that they don't have to query across the globe but it will have the same problem or \ngathering analytics as request never hits our primary server.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "53knh5pVDAZfxLhX4abyR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1625.6075989669987,
      "y": 1005.2985111249315,
      "width": 1120.6793212890625,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ah",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1919254822,
      "version": 487,
      "versionNonce": 705291834,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783062716083,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Draft 2 : Scaling our desing\n\n100M DAU = 10^8 / 10^5 (seconds in day) = 1000 req/sec - * 10 - 100(peak request hours) --> 10k - 100k req/sec\nEC2/ T2 med can handle 1000 req/sec --> Hence we need to scale our Primary Server.\n\nObservation our service is read heavy i.e. less call to new URL creation and more to just reading and redirecting.\nSensible to scale read and write separately.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Draft 2 : Scaling our desing\n\n100M DAU = 10^8 / 10^5 (seconds in day) = 1000 req/sec - * 10 - 100(peak request hours) --> 10k - 100k req/sec\nEC2/ T2 med can handle 1000 req/sec --> Hence we need to scale our Primary Server.\n\nObservation our service is read heavy i.e. less call to new URL creation and more to just reading and redirecting.\nSensible to scale read and write separately.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
